<title>USA: FelCor, Doubletree join to buy 3 hotels.</title>
<headline>FelCor, Doubletree join to buy 3 hotels.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FelCor Suite Hotels Inc said on Monday that it and Doubletree Corp formed a joint venture to acquire three Doubletree Guest Suites hotels for about $80 million.</p>
<p>The hotels, in Austin, Texas, Troy, Mich., and near the Baltimore-Washington International Airport, were acquired from AEW Capital Management LP, FelCor said.</p>
<p>FelCor, general partner of the newly-formed venture, will pay $72 million for the three hotels. Doubletree, of Phoenix, will pay $8 million as a limited partner.</p>
<p>FelCor is a real-estate investment trust that focuses on all-suite hotels.</p>
